<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device"><diagram id="dp45-implementation-b" name="B: 공통 관계 생산과 게시본 조회"><mxGraphModel page="1" pageWidth="3840" pageHeight="2160"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="im" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Interaction Manager" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="238" width="600" height="170" /></mxCell><mxCell id="input" parent="im" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;InputReady&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;R23 / input revision / evidence refs&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="72" width="520" height="88" /></mxCell><mxCell id="scenario" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;같은 사용자 장면과 원본&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;R23: “지난번 설명한 기준에 제품 비교와 견적을 맞춰 제안서를 만들어줘.”&lt;br&gt;과거 원본: E20 설명 / P20 실제 전달 [0,52) / T21 → D21 개정 2 / T22 → D22 개정 1&lt;br&gt;검색 시작 전에는 위 ID가 target binding으로 주어지지 않는다. 검색 결과로 후보를 얻는다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="744" y="238" width="2360" height="170" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;도형과 실행 범위&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;직각 상자: Component / 내부 둥근 상자: 코드&lt;br&gt;원통: RAM 또는 DURABLE 상태&lt;br&gt;살구색: A/B에서 달라지는 내부 조직&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3184" y="238" width="592" height="170" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rc" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Request Controller" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="470" width="600" height="450" /></mxCell><mxCell id="scope" parent="rc" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Scope / Adoption Gate&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;입력 개정, 허용 source 범위와 budget 등록&lt;br&gt;MeaningProposal의 현재성 검사와 채택&lt;br&gt;채택 후 Task Manager에 위임 요청&lt;br&gt;확정 Request와 사용 refs는 State Store&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="80" width="520" height="175" /></mxCell><mxCell id="history" parent="rc" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;History Read Port&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;주제 / 입력 / 채택 정정의 검색과 읽기&lt;br&gt;명시 REVISES / 당시 revision 반환&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="310" width="520" height="110" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ri" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Request Interpreter" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="1030" width="600" height="410" /></mxCell><mxCell id="read_tool" parent="ri" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Read Tool Runner&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;query_id / read_id / Request / attempt&lt;br&gt;EvidenceQuery → async 완료를 같은 caller로&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="80" width="520" height="125" /></mxCell><mxCell id="meaning" parent="ri" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Current Meaning Job&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Bundle로 현재 목표와 Task 연결 제안&lt;br&gt;추가 읽기 또는 질문 / 자동 채택 아님&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="260" width="520" height="115" /></mxCell><mxCell id="model" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Model Access" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="1520" width="600" height="195" /></mxCell><mxCell id="api" parent="model" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Semantic API Client&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;scope / call ID / timeout / cancel / usage&lt;br&gt;현재 의미와 조건부 생산의 역할 분리&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="70" width="520" height="115" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cloud" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Cloud semantic model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;외부 dependency / 입력 허용 범위만 전송&lt;br&gt;취소 실패 후 완료와 청구도 추적&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=hexagon;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="1785" width="600" height="115" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cm" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Context Manager" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="744" y="470" width="2360" height="1250" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rm" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Response Manager" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3184" y="470" width="592" height="360" /></mxCell><mxCell id="response_read" parent="rm" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Response History Port&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;search(topic, range, cursor)&lt;br&gt;read(E20, revision, span)&lt;br&gt;read(P20, actual Text / Voice spans)&lt;br&gt;초안과 실제 전달을 구별&lt;br&gt;원문과 actual receipt: DURABLE&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="80" width="512" height="225" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tm" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Task Manager" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3184" y="910" width="592" height="360" /></mxCell><mxCell id="task_read" parent="tm" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Task History Port&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;search(topic, range, cursor)&lt;br&gt;read(T21 / T22, result refs)&lt;br&gt;D21@v2 / D22@v1 / source revision&lt;br&gt;Agent Gateway의 확인 사건에서 저장&lt;br&gt;Task / 결과 참조: DURABLE&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="80" width="512" height="225" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pm" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Policy Manager" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3184" y="1350" width="592" height="370" /></mxCell><mxCell id="policy" parent="pm" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Use Authorization Port&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;현재 scope와 permission epoch&lt;br&gt;checkAndRegisterUse(expected epoch)&lt;br&gt;철회 commit → 구 epoch 사용 차단&lt;br&gt;긴 read / 모델 완료를 기다리지 않음&lt;br&gt;권한 및 삭제 상태: DURABLE&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="80" width="512" height="210" /></mxCell><mxCell id="publisher" parent="cm" vertex="1" value="Memory Publisher / 현재 요청과 독립적인 생산 수명" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="70" width="2280" height="540" /></mxCell><mxCell id="derive" parent="publisher" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Relation Builder&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;PRESENTS / HAS_RESULT / REVISES: 코드&lt;br&gt;EXPLAINS_ITEM: 조건부 C-CONTEXT&lt;br&gt;원문 span / uncertainty / producer version&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="90" width="600" height="160" /></mxCell><mxCell id="source_worker" parent="publisher" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Source Read Worker&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;ProductionJob의 source vector로 읽기&lt;br&gt;bounded async 원본 읽기 / 현재성 확인&lt;br&gt;미공개 설명과 미래 Request binding 제외&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="850" y="90" width="600" height="160" /></mxCell><mxCell id="admit" parent="publisher" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Change Admission / Planner&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;확정 변경 또는 지원 범위 backfill 수용&lt;br&gt;원본 변경 → 해당 dependency 사용 차단&lt;br&gt;권한 / budget 확인 후 production 등록&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1660" y="90" width="580" height="160" /></mxCell><mxCell id="candidate" parent="publisher" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Candidate Batch (RAM)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;job ID / source vector / epoch&lt;br&gt;proposed relations / spans / gaps&lt;br&gt;게시 전이므로 Reader가 읽지 않음&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder;size=13;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="350" width="600" height="155" /></mxCell><mxCell id="commit" parent="publisher" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Publish Guard / Commit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;현재 dependency / epoch / expected rev 검사&lt;br&gt;records + Coverage + cursors 함께 확정&lt;br&gt;충돌 / 오래된 생산 → RETRY 또는 REJECT&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="850" y="350" width="600" height="155" /></mxCell><mxCell id="journal" parent="publisher" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Production Journal (DURABLE)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;job key / queued / running / retry&lt;br&gt;source refs + producer version 중복 제거&lt;br&gt;callback / 재시도 / 게시 통지 outbox&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder;size=13;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1660" y="350" width="580" height="155" /></mxCell><mxCell id="waits" parent="cm" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Read Wait Registry (RAM)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;read_id → 필요한 범위 / min publish rev&lt;br&gt;deadline / 취소 / consumer 연결&lt;br&gt;PublishResult는 알림. 저장소 재조회 필수&lt;br&gt;consumer 종료와 생산 작업 종료는 별개&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder;size=13;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="80" y="690" width="600" height="200" /></mxCell><mxCell id="repository" parent="cm" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Episodic Memory Repository (DURABLE)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;MemoryRecord + Coverage + published revision + source별 committed cursor&lt;br&gt;topic / owner / 시간 색인, dependency 역색인, VALID / DIRTY / REVOKED&lt;br&gt;relation과 Coverage는 같은 snapshot으로 읽기. 미생산과 미지원은 서로 다른 상태.&lt;br&gt;원본 사실과 현재 Task 상태는 해당 owner 권위. 원본 전체의 동시 snapshot이 아님.&lt;br&gt;물리 저장은 State Store / 원본이 보존된 범위에서만 재생산 가능&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder;size=13;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="890" y="670" width="1390" height="230" /></mxCell><mxCell id="reader" parent="cm" vertex="1" value="Evidence Reader / 현재 read 수명" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="950" width="2280" height="265" /></mxCell><mxCell id="read" parent="reader" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Read Pump / Bundle Builder&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;query / read ID / 허용 scope / budget&lt;br&gt;후보와 근거 + 실제 확인 범위로 Bundle 생성&lt;br&gt;최종 Use Guard 검사 → caller에 reply 1회&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="80" width="600" height="160" /></mxCell><mxCell id="coverage" parent="reader" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Index / Coverage Resolver&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;게시된 후보 검색 → 범위와 kind 확인&lt;br&gt;COVERED → 검증 / NOT_COVERED → 생산 대기&lt;br&gt;UNSUPPORTED → 제한 반환 / B+는 별도&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="850" y="80" width="600" height="160" /></mxCell><mxCell id="origin" parent="reader" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Origin Verifier&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;현재 source revision / policy 확인&lt;br&gt;정확한 인용: 게시 locator의 원문만 읽기&lt;br&gt;stale / 삭제 / 접근 실패를 반환&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1660" y="80" width="580" height="160" /></mxCell><mxCell id="trace" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;준비된 조회와 첫 조회를 구별&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;준비됨: 7 → 8 → 9 → 10. 동일한 E20 원문과 두 결과 refs 반환.&lt;br&gt;미생산: 7 → 8 → 11 → 생산 2~6 → 12 → 8 재조회 → 9 → 10.&lt;br&gt;생산 대기는 해당 read만 묶는다. 입력과 다른 요청은 계속 처리.&lt;br&gt;Publisher는 Bundle을 직접 caller에 반환하지 않는다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="744" y="1850" width="1110" height="205" /></mxCell><mxCell id="failure" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;원본 변경, 취소와 재시작&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;D21 변경: dependency 사용 차단 → 새 생산 → 조건부 게시.&lt;br&gt;read 취소: waiter 해제. 허용된 공유 생산은 유용성과 budget 재검사.&lt;br&gt;게시 전 crash: cursor는 미진행. 게시 후 통지 유실: revision 재조회.&lt;br&gt;철회된 epoch의 늦은 생산은 commit 거절. 물리 purge는 재시도.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1924" y="1850" width="1180" height="205" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wire1" source="input" target="scope" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#195FBD;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;exitX=0.8461538461538461;exitY=1.0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.8461538461538461;entryY=0.0;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire2" source="scope" target="read_tool" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#263445;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;exitX=0.0;exitY=0.5;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0;entryY=0.5;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint as="point" x="34" y="637.5" /><mxPoint as="point" x="34" y="1172.5" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire3" source="read_tool" target="meaning" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#195FBD;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire4" source="meaning" target="scope" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#195FBD;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;exitX=1.0;exitY=0.5;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1.0;entryY=0.5;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint as="point" x="684" y="1347.5" /><mxPoint as="point" x="684" y="637.5" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire5" source="meaning" target="api" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#263445;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;exitX=0.34615384615384615;exitY=1.0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.34615384615384615;entryY=0.0;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire6" source="api" target="meaning" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#195FBD;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;exitX=1.0;exitY=0.5;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1.0;entryY=0.6739130434782609;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint as="point" x="650" y="1647.5" /><mxPoint as="point" x="650" y="1367.5" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire7" source="api" target="cloud" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#263445;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;exitX=0.34615384615384615;exitY=1.0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.36666666666666664;entryY=0.0;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire8" source="cloud" target="api" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#195FBD;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;exitX=0.6333333333333333;exitY=0.0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.6538461538461539;entryY=1.0;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire9" source="response_read" target="admit" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#195FBD;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;exitX=0.0;exitY=0.43333333333333335;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1.0;entryY=0.109375;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint as="point" x="3094" y="647.5" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire10" source="task_read" target="admit" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#195FBD;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;exitX=0.0;exitY=0.8333333333333334;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1.0;entryY=0.890625;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint as="point" x="3078" y="1177.5" /><mxPoint as="point" x="3078" y="772.5" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire11" source="admit" target="journal" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#758294;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire12" source="journal" target="source_worker" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#195FBD;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;exitX=0.0;exitY=0.5;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1.0;entryY=0.71875;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint as="point" x="2374" y="967.5" /><mxPoint as="point" x="2374" y="745" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire13" source="source_worker" target="journal" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#758294;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;exitX=1.0;exitY=0.40625;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0;entryY=0.27419354838709675;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint as="point" x="2394" y="695" /><mxPoint as="point" x="2394" y="932.5" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire14" source="source_worker" target="derive" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#263445;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;exitX=0.0;exitY=0.5;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1.0;entryY=0.5;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry a